"Hi, I'm Milan Khanchi, a Computer Science Engineering student at Chitkara University and currently a DevOps 
Fellow at the BridgeLab Fellowship Program.

During my fellowship, I started with Linux and networking fundamentals and then moved into Microsoft 
Azure and cloud infrastructure.

I've worked hands-on with Azure services such as VNets, subnets, NSGs, ASGs, VMs, VM Scale Sets, Load 
Balancers, NAT Gateway, Azure Firewall, routing, VNet peering, Managed Identities, Key Vault, Azure Policy
 and MySQL Flexible Server.

One of my major projects was deploying a three-tier Django chat application on Azure, where I separated 
