 access to Key Vault and the database.

Alongside DevOps, I have a development background with Java, Spring Boot, Node.js, React and databases 
such as PostgreSQL, MySQL and MongoDB.

I'm particularly interested in understanding how applications are deployed, secured, connected and operated 
reliably in cloud environments."



